Facturas demo is a learning kit by NARSIL Intelligence, © 2026 NARSIL Intelligence, all
rights reserved. It is free to download, run, study and modify for learning, personally or
within your organisation, and you may build your own projects with the techniques it teaches
and show what you learned, citing the kit. You may NOT sell or commercialise it or modified
versions, charge for training or services based on it, redistribute it outside the official
repository, integrate it into products or services for third parties, or remove its notices.
All data in the kit is fictitious. Third-party components keep their own licenses. The kit
is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. Breach terminates the license. Spanish
law applies.
